  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "abliterated",
    "description": "Executable gated Candidate for Drowzeys' complete Red Hat compressed-tensors L15-43/MTP-L45 checkpoint with the bf582e4e DFlash2 K7 drafter. It binds tonyd2wild's worker-first native-mp TP2 profile and exact required SM121 sparse-indexer replacement: 262K context, block size 2304, Marlin MoE, FP8 E4M3 KV, 0.85 unified-memory utilization, 8K batched tokens, eager execution, an 8 GiB pinned KV pool, images on with video off, the checkpoint's exact thinking-off template, and upstream's draft-group prefix-cache repair built into the image. Installation requires prior acceptance of both Drowzeys' responsible-use gate and the drafter's separate CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0 terms, plus a read-only Hugging Face token supplied through the Controller; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance remains pending.",
    "tags": [
