      "help": "Drafting method. DFlash2 k=7 with the incoai drafter is the upstream default. MTP uses the checkpoint's own MTP-L45 head with the values of upstream's MTP launcher (4 tokens, 4 GiB KV pin); it is not upstream's tuned path and is untested here.",
